        <p class="ed-lead">
          Search Amazon for a cheap incline walking pad with handles and CURSOR FITNESS turns up again and again: pads
          promising 15, 16, 17 or 18% incline, a steep walker that climbs to 32%, and folding treadmills with a 20%
          automatic incline. Some of these listings are the same machine in a different colour; some quote one figure in
          the title and another in the bullets; four do not carry the brand name in the title at all. This guide reads
          each one line by line: who is behind CURSOR FITNESS, which models Amazon sold on 27 November 2026 and at what
          price, who sells them, what the warranty says, and which figures you should not rely on. Nothing here was tested
          hands-on; it is built from the listings, their product details and the brand's website.
        </p>

